# The libraries in schedr's base image, for tasks to use (see PROJECT.md, Components and roles:
# the base image's libraries). Pinned with their dependencies in requirements.txt by
# `make image-requirements`; an image of your own built FROM this one can add or pin others.
# API calls
requests
httpx
aiohttp
tenacity
# Data
polars
orjson
pyyaml
python-dateutil
# Networking: SSH and SFTP, device CLIs, NETCONF, DNS, addresses
paramiko
netmiko
ncclient
dnspython
netaddr
# MongoDB (no musllinux wheel: built in the image's builder stage)
pymongo
